{"source":"github","project_id":"db-rstudio-com","target":"rstudio/db.rstudio.com","id":"pr/112","ref":112,"title":"Google Search Console verification file","description":"Hi @blairj09 \r\n\r\nThis html file is required in order for RStudio's Google Search Console account to verify ownership of the site; there are other ways to verify, but none of them apply to this site unfortunately. Google Search Console is separate from Google Analytics, and lets us see how this site's pages appear in Google search results.\r\n\r\nThis file must remain intact (no changes) in the repo in order for RStudio's Google Search Console account to verify ownership of the site.\r\n\r\nPlease merge this PR as soon as you are able.\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\nSarah","published_at":"2020-12-02T18:06:43Z","updated_at":"2020-12-03T16:30:10Z","url":"https://github.com/rstudio/db.rstudio.com/pull/112","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"sarahemlin","merged_at":"2020-12-03T16:30:10Z","state":"MERGED"}}
